==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{term|tribunus|tribūnus|tribune|lang=la}}, from {{term|tribus||tribe|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/triˈbuː.nal/|lang=la}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|tribūnal|tribunalis|tribūnālis|n|third}}

# A [[raise]]d [[semicircular]] or [[square]] [[platform]], on which the [[seat]]s of [[magistrate]]s were [[place]]d; [[#English|tribunal]], [[judgment seat]].
